# Business Patterns — VTC Apps

Data: `data-model.mdc`. Screens: `ux-screens.mdc`. API: `api-routes.mdc`.

## Default Capabilities (every CRUD entity)

| Capability | Required |
|------------|----------|
| Search | Yes — `q` param, server-side |
| Pagination | `limit` (default 20, max 100), `offset` |
| Sort | `sort` + `order` asc/desc; default `updated_at` desc |
| Soft delete | Unless user asks for hard delete |
| Form validation | Client + server before submit |

## List API

```
GET /api/[entity]/list?q=&limit=20&offset=0&sort=updated_at&order=desc
```

| Param | Default | Behavior |
|-------|---------|----------|
| `q` | — | Case-insensitive regex on text fields |
| `limit` | `20` | Cap 100 |
| `offset` | `0` | Pagination |
| `sort` | `updated_at` | Whitelist server-side |
| `status` | active | `all` = non-deleted; admin views for archived/deleted |

## Delete — Soft (default)

```typescript
await db.collection(COLLECTION).updateOne(
  { _id: id, ...scopeFilter },
  { $set: { status: 'deleted', updated_at: new Date().toISOString() } }
)
```

`scopeFilter`: Shared app includes `group_id`; Dedicated uses id only.

## Role Guards

| Action | Rule |
|--------|------|
| List / read | Authenticated; Shared scoped to `group_id` |
| Create | Authenticated member+ |
| Update any | `isAdmin(user)` |
| Soft delete | Admin/owner or creator per brief |
| View deleted | `isAdmin(user)` |

## Forms

Validate before submit; disable button while loading; all copy via i18n (`i18n.mdc`).
